1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:03,648
(Leonard:)Fine. I'll take him for shoes
next Saturday.

2
00:00:03,819 --> 00:00:07,239
(Penny:)No. A bunch of us from work
are going to Disneyland next Saturday...

3
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:09,326
(Penny:)...and Sheldon wants to come.

4
00:00:09,741 --> 00:00:11,281
(Leonard:)You're taking him to Disneyland?

5
00:00:11,451 --> 00:00:15,661
(Penny:)Well, he heard me making plans
on the phone. Was I gonna say no?

6
00:00:16,957 --> 00:00:20,377
(Leonard:)All right, but let me know if you're
gonna stuff him with junk food.

7
00:00:20,544 --> 00:00:24,134
I don't wanna bring home a nice dinner
for him and see it go to waste.

8
00:00:25,966 --> 00:00:28,926
(Penny:)We're going to Disneyland.
He's gonna eat junk food.

9
00:00:29,636 --> 00:00:32,136
(Leonard:)All I'm saying is give me a heads-up.

10
00:00:32,639 --> 00:00:33,719
(Penny:)Okay, whatever.

11
00:00:35,642 --> 00:00:38,102
(Leonard:)And don't let him go on Space Mountain
after he eats.

12
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:42,730
He'll say he can handle it, but you'll
end up with churro puke on your shoes.

13
00:00:42,899 --> 00:00:44,739
All right. Got it. Anything else?

14
00:00:44,901 --> 00:00:46,111
(Leonard:)Don't let Goofy near him.

15
00:00:46,278 --> 00:00:48,948
(Leonard:)He'll have nightmares,
and I'll have to deal with it.

16
00:00:49,156 --> 00:00:59,026
(Penny:)-What's the problem with Goofy?
-Wish I knew. He's fine with Pluto.

